The Accurate-Salamander Project is remastering existing sampled sound
sources (original sound sources) to produce new SFZ grand piano soundbanks of
instrument maker-level quality, using a physics-based approach. 

Official site
https://www.ir.isas.jaxa.jp/~cyamauch/AccurateSalamander/

--------

Low-footprint version by Jeff Learman of SFZ Instruments Organization:

Accurate Salamander Grand for Zynthian
https://github.com/jlearman/zynthian-salamander-grand


